{"v":4,"catch":"撲滅大火！","desc":"\"GUZZLER\"是由TEHKAN (KOEI TECMO GAMES)於1983年推出的一款動作遊戲。\n控制Guzzler這個快樂的消防員，撲滅肆虐的大火。\n由於火勢不斷催生敵人，快速的決定和行動是勝利的關鍵!\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-05-13","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/676ffe7b4fc030565b14cfe77508d12d66fbd600046e27ad5714efe3eecaf4fc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8865d7a5a8ecdfbd9c8e85b955d6c28c6cb9f0e22d2281c2e9ef0c78c0cdefbb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d7b642e2a726bbb370d6c0392f171667bd7e1c1449fb299c26ef744ad68aa150.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a1953f7d9fb8cbaa6aff6427f75ca42b644006abdf7794a9ae802abb76e0c87.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0cd62ce51d6ef8c07023220e790a992f6b2c168c48f1810732b1f4036cf05878.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ef290f3060019f7611a77bd09731e7e2c6da97f9623f14ea9755646f5af0b91.jpg"],"titleId":"010025e01450e000","dlc":[]}